                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p> </p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 27px"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">绍教工〔2021〕6号</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 33px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 29px"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 33px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 29px"> </span></strong></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 29px">关于<a name="_Hlk60749904"></a>开展绍兴市教育系统“最美志愿者”“最美志愿服务组织”选树活动的通知</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">各区、县（市）教育工会，市直有关工会：</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">为全面贯彻落实党的十九大精神，市教育工会深入开展“践行新思想</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: '微软雅黑','sans-serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">•</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">奋进新时代”助力脱贫攻坚职工志愿服务活动。我市广大教职工积极参与多种形式的扶贫协助和对口支援活动，涌现出一大批先进典型。为</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">宣传我市教职工积极投身助力打赢脱贫攻坚战等各类志愿活动中的最美现象，充分发挥先进典型的示范作用，大力弘扬奉献、友爱、互助、进步的志愿精神，鼓励更多教职工积极投身到志愿服务中，为忠实践行“八八战略”、奋力打造“重要窗口”做出积极贡献，市教育工会决定开展“最美志愿者”“最美志愿服务组织”选树活动。现就有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">一、组织领导</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">指导单位：浙江省教育工会  绍兴市总工会</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">主办单位：绍兴市教育工会</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">二、选树范围</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">全市教育系统内教职工志愿者及志愿服务组织。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">三、选树名额</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">各区、县（市）选树名额不超过集体3家、个人3人，市直有关学校选树最多集体1家或个人1人。已获得过各级最美教师和最美教师提名、相关志愿者和志愿组织荣誉的不再参加选树。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">四、选树条件</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">（一）最美志愿者选树条件</span></span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有正确的志愿服务理念。拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，积极践行社会主义核心价值观，大力弘扬奉献、友爱、互助、进步的志愿精神，有很强的社会责任意识、奉献意识。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有优质的志愿服务项目。通过实施志愿服务项目，发挥优势资源的带动作用，传授先进理念和技术，服务基层、服务职工，送去优质的教育、科技、文化、医疗、健康等资源。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有较长的志愿服务时间。积极参加各类志愿服务活动<a name="_Hlk62133696"></a>，志愿服务累计达两年及以上（参加抗疫志愿活动需一年及以上）。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">4.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有显著的志愿服务成效。为志愿服务活动做出重要贡献。在志愿服务活动中成绩突出、影响广泛，受广大师生及社会认同，社会反响良好，具有良好的社会示范作用。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">（二）最美志愿服务组织选树条件</span></span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">1</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">．有稳定的志愿服务团队。团队志愿者人数原则上不少于10人。 </span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有明确的志愿服务领域。经常性在该领域开展有意义的志愿服务活动，广泛宣传普及志愿服务理念，积极倡导志愿服务精神。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 14px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有明确的志愿服务项目。项目定位明确、运作规范，操作性强，具备完整的工作方案、规范的管理制度、科学的运作模式、齐全的档案资料。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">4.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有较长的志愿服务时间。志愿服务累计达两年及以上（抗疫志愿服务需一年及以上）。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">5.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">有显著的志愿服务成效。在各类志愿服务领域贡献突出，成效显著。师生认可度高，服务对象评价高，社会效益良好，具有良好的示范作用和社会影响力。  </span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">五、选树程序</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">（一）推荐阶段（2021年2月-3月1日）</span></span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">推荐程序</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">上报数量不超过推荐名额，且在本地区、本校内组织民主推荐并进行公示，公示无异议，并经有关部门审核同意后正式上报。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">（二）评审阶段（2021年3月10日前）</span></strong></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">绍兴市教育工会组织专家评审，确定最终名单，在绍兴市总工会网站上公示。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><strong><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">（三）表彰阶段（2021年6月）</span></span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">选树集体和个人由绍兴市教育工会进行发文表彰，颁发荣誉证书。其中特别优秀的集体和个人，将作为绍兴代表参加省教育系统“最美志愿者”及“最美志愿服务组织”的选树。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">六、其他事宜</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">各单位要高度重视选树活动，精心组织实施，广泛发动、层层推荐。按照“公平、公正、公开”原则，认真做好选树和宣传工作，于3月1日前报送申报材料，逾期视为自动放弃，以电子邮件发送时间为准。请将申报材料纸质稿一式三份加盖公章邮寄至绍兴市教育工会，电子稿通过钉钉发送至绍兴市教育工会张建国。各区、县（市）由所在教育工会统一报送。报送材料时请同时报送联系人1名和具体联系方式，报送文件名以“报送单位+联系人+联系方式”命名。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">联系人：绍兴市教育工会  张建国</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">电话：85200278</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">地址：绍兴市凤林西路8号职工之家1910室</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">邮编：312000</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 85px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">附件1.</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -1px; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">绍兴市教育系统“最美志愿者”申报表</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16px"><img style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2px" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="COLOR: #0066cc; FONT-SIZE: 12px" title="202102041521516429.docx" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/2/202102041521516429.docx">202102041521516429.docx</a></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"></span></span> </p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">        </span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">2.</span><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">绍兴市<span style="LETTER-SPACING: -1px; COLOR: black">教育系统“最美志愿服务组织”申报表</span></span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16px"><img style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2px" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="COLOR: #0066cc; FONT-SIZE: 12px" title="202102041522598525.docx" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/2/202102041522598525.docx">202102041522598525.docx</a></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"></span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">                           </span><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">绍兴市教育工会</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">                           2021</span><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px">年2月3日</span></span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0px 85px 0px 0px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 21px"> </span></p>
    
